OL,3,GNEWSATrio deny attempted murder after  
OL,4,Ateens shot                             
OL,6,FTwo men and a 17-year-old boy have     
OL,7,Fdenied trying to murder two teenagers  
OL,8,Fwho were both shot in the face in a    
OL,9,Ftown centre.                           
OL,11,FEssex Police was called to Market Place
OL,12,Fin Braintree at 22:10 BST on 31 August 
OL,13,Fafter the boys suffered serious        
OL,14,Finjuries.                              
OL,16,FDestiny Ema, 23, of Meadgate Avenue in 
OL,17,FChelmsford, Kayden Brown, 18, of Noakes
OL,18,FAvenue, Chelmsford, and the 17-year-old
OL,19,Ffrom Braintree were charged.           
