OL,3,GNEWSATrio deny attempted murder after  
OL,4,Ateens shot                             
OL,6,FThey all pleaded not guilty to two     
OL,7,Fcounts of attempted murder at          
OL,8,FChelmsford Crown Court on Monday.      
